/Title (Conclusion : Thus, we successfully created and deployed an ERC-20 token smart contract using Solidity in Remix IDE. We understood the ERC-20 token standard, implemented its important functions, and tested token operations such as transferring tokens, checking account balances, and managing allowances. This experiment provided practical knowledge of smart contract development and the working of fungible tokens on the Ethereum blockchain.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 127 0 R
>>
